<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch PTT shares rise on split news.</title>
<headline>Dutch PTT shares rise on split news.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch post and telecoms group PTT Nederland NV rose seven percent in early trade on Tuesday after the company announced plans to split the company in two.</p>
<p>The shares were 5.50 guilders higher at 81.20 guilders, minutes after the bourse opening. Earlier the company said it would separate its postal and telecommunications units into two independent companies in the spring of 1998.</p>
</text>
